# Blog articles migrated from Medium.
#
# Prettier does two damaging things to these files, so they are excluded here at
# the repository root — lint-staged runs Prettier from the root, and Prettier
# only reads the .prettierignore in its working directory, so the app-level file
# does not cover the pre-commit path.
#
# 1. It rewrites published article content. Code examples get reformatted
#    (quote style, and prettier-plugin-tailwindcss reorders class lists), so the
#    article ends up showing code the author never wrote.
# 2. It breaks MDX escapes and hard breaks. Markdown reflow splits `\{add\}`
#    across lines, leaving the brace unescaped, and strips the two trailing
#    spaces that make a <br> a hard line break.
#
# The converter's output is canonical; nothing here needs a formatter.
